# gui-menus: from the GUI chapter (see the chapter text for the Forth code).
banner
prompt
eval 0 40 10 48 UI-SURFACE\n1 0 160 120 40 10 UI-VISIBLE UI-DECOR OR UI-SHADOW OR UI-WINDOW\nS" Notes" 1 UI-TITLE\nS" Hello from the CPU" 0 1 1 48 UI-TYPE\n0 0 3 40 1 2 48 UI-FILL\n0 19 1 3 TRUE UI-CARET\n1 UI-FOCUS  UI-COMMIT
place 1 160 40
eval S" &New note"   200 UI-ENABLED 0 UI-CTRL 110 UI-COMMAND\nS" &Word wrap"  201 UI-ENABLED UI-CHECKED OR 0 0 0 UI-COMMAND\nS" &Large font" 202 0 0 0 0 UI-COMMAND\nS" &Quit"       203 UI-ENABLED UI-STATUS OR 0 UI-CTRL 113 UI-COMMAND\n201 202 2 S" View" 2 UI-MENU\n200 2 UI-SUBMENU UI-SEPARATOR 203 4 S" Notes" 1 UI-MENU\n1 1 UI-POPUP\n201 UI-ENABLED UI-STATE\nUI-COMMIT
focus 1
key F10 s
key DOWN
key RIGHT
shot gui-menus
